{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PpkTda6nPRBy45B469gxVv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_10/projects/provenance_weight_training/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# provenance_weight_training — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 10:03 UTC | 更新原因: 4/4 GPU 满载更新：ESS-only + golden ratio + nmin1 + τ sweep 运行中\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nDual-constrained adaptive b*：α_eff 质量下界 + ESS 稳定上界 → 最小干预准则。per-batch 自适应推导 b*，替代 Drayson 的 validation-based grid search。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（D023 dual-constraint 框架）+ 审稿并行\\\\n- **投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25（10 天）\\\\n- **MVP**: ✅ PASS (D019)\\\\n- **Framing**: D023 dual-constraint ✅ | D025 τ empirical HP ✅\\\\n- **Grid sweep**: seed42+123 完整 (b=0.5-5.0) ✅ | seed456 b=0.5/1.0/1.5 ✅ | seed456 b=2.0/3.0/5.0 invalidated (D026 checkpoint resume artifact)\\\\n- **τ 修复**: ✅ 完成 (τ=0.8 固定 CLI 参数)\\\\n- **实验汇总**: ✅ artifacts/experiment_summary.md（Grid-best=b=0.5, adaptive 恢复 91%）\\\\n\\\\n## RUNNING 实验\\\\n| GPU | 实验 | 类型 | ETA (UTC) |\\\\n|-----|------|------|-----------|\\\\n| cuda:0 | golden_ratio_seed42 | oracle baseline | ~13:00 |\\\\n| cuda:1 | ess_only_seed42 | **CRITICAL** max-intervention baseline | ~13:00 |\\\\n| cuda:2 | nmin1_seed42 | n_min sensitivity | ~13:00 |\\\\n| cuda:3 | tau_06_seed42 | τ sweep 第一组 (τ=0.6) | ~13:30 |\\\\n\\\\n## ESS-only 早期信号\\\\n初始 b* = 5.36/2.95（vs adaptive median 0.88）— max-intervention 行为确认。最终 PPL 待训练完成。\\\\n\\\\n## 下一批排期（~13:30 后）\\\\n| 优先级 | 实验 | GPU 需求 |\\\\n|--------|------|---------|\\\\n| 1 | τ=0.5 seed42 | 1 GPU |\\\\n| 2 | τ=0.7 seed42 | 1 GPU |\\\\n| 3 | τ=0.9 seed42 | 1 GPU |\\\\n| 4 | τ=0.95 seed42 | 1 GPU |\\\\n| 5 | n_min=4 seed42 | 1 GPU |\\\\n| 6 | batch_size=8 seed42 | 1 GPU |\\\\n| 7 | batch_size=16 seed42 | 1 GPU |\\\\n| 低 | grid_b_low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3) | 1 GPU, ~11h |\\\\n\\\\nτ sweep 4 组可并行 4 GPU（~3.6h），之后 n_min=4 + batchsize。\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算（D024+D026+D027）\\\\n分配: 4× RTX 6000 Pro 96G (westd-47453)\\\\n已消耗: ~115h | 剩余: ~65h\\\\n当前批: 4×3.6h = ~14.4h\\\\nτ sweep 剩余: 4×3.6h = ~14.4h（并行 = 3.6h 实际）\\\\nn_min=4 + batchsize: ~10.8h\\\\n**预计 P0 总需: ~40h → 余量 ~25h**（D026 不重跑 + D027 grid_b_low 降优先级释放了 ~20h）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键待验证\\\\n1. **ESS-only baseline 结果**（~13:00）— 决定论文 framing 走向（D023 Key Risk #1）\\\\n2. **τ sweep**（D025 后成为 Claim 3 唯一直接实证支撑）\\\\n3. **Golden Ratio 对比**（Claim 3 oracle baseline）\\\\n4. **n_min=1 极端 case**（boundary condition）\\\\n\\\\n## 论文写作准备\\\\n- 文献扫描 Worker 运行中（35+ 论文，9 must-add）\\\\n- aggregation 口径：论文用 ratio of means (89.9%) 而非 mean of ratios (91.0%)\\\\n- seed456 b≥2.0 用 2 seeds + appendix 注明 checkpoint resume artifact\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-15 | D027: grid_b_low 降优先级，τ sweep 提前；cuda:2→nmin1, cud | grid_b_low_seed42, ess_only_seed42 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-15 | D026: Checkpoint resume artifact — seed456 b=2.0/3 | grid_b2_0_seed456 |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-15 | D025: τ 理论来源确认依赖已知比例 — 降级为 empirical hyperparamete | — |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-15 | D024: GPU 预算决策 — Llama-3B 降级 P1，P0 聚焦核心消融；强化 ESS-o | — |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-15 | D023: 修正 D021/D022 过度修正 — α_eff 非 decorative，dual- | adaptive_fix_seed42 |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-15 | D021 应对：优先级重排 + experiment_plan 补充 τ/GR/batchsize  | adaptive_fix_seed42, dream_20260515T011902 |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-15 | D021: α_eff 确认退化为 ESS 阈值化 + τ 依赖 contamination_rat | — |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-15 | Dream 全三档 Weak Reject：α_eff 框架可能退化为 ESS 阈值化，需实验验证  | dream_20260515T011902 |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-15 | MVP PASS (Path B): aggregate ratio 88.6% < 90% 但定性 | adaptive_fix_seed42, adaptive_fix_seed123, adaptive_fix_seed456, grid_b0_5_seed456 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-14 | 撤回 D016 warning：v1→v2 无混淆变量，唯一差异为 n_min(3→2)。78% b | adaptive_fix_seed42, adaptive_fix_seed123, adaptive_fix_seed456 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3341, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ANGBXxKQAKoxoZu2GDttXi","session_id":"bd81513d-34ac-46ce-a706-72967144b268","uuid":"8da175ce-4f09-49ab-bdf9-09f5d8a5ee2d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T11:09:00.999Z"}
